OL,3,GNEWSACompany defends mortuary plan at
OL,4,Abusiness park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA company has defended its plans for a
OL,7,Fmortuary that would store up to 700
OL,8,Fbodies in a village near York.
OL,10,FThe proposed facility at York Business
OL,11,FPark in Nether Poppleton would be
OL,12,Fconverted from a former mobile network
OL,13,Fswitching centre..
OL,15,FO'Neill Associates, acting on behalf of
OL,16,FPure Cremation, said the facility would
OL,17,Fcause negligible levels of traffic and
OL,18,Fnoise issues and the scale of the
OL,19,Fbuilding would remain unchanged.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
