OL,3,GNEWSACompany defends mortuary plan at
OL,4,Abusiness park
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, objectors have branded the
OL,7,Fproposed mortuary "appalling" and
OL,8,F"undignified", likening it to a
OL,9,F"production line" and "mass storage
OL,10,Ffacility".
